ded.","The processed CSVs carry no quality column, so no quality-bit mask can be applied here; non-finite values are dropped instead.","Measured depth is limited by cadence: with 29.4-minute Kepler sampling the transit centre may fall between exposures, so the measured value is a lower bound on the true injected decrement."]},"scientific_notice":"The injected transit is simulated and overlaid on real observations. It is not a detection, it does not reproduce the saved Phase 5 experiment, and no model is trained or evaluated by this view."}